  "summary": {
    "zh-CN": "由南丁格尔本人带孩子走完她的一生，从庄园花园到战地医院和统计图表，并分清史实、传说与改编。",
    "en": "Walk through the life of Florence Nightingale with the nurse herself, telling history, legend, and adaptation apart."
  },
